{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   This is **Phase 1 of 2 — PLANNING**. I am the planning agent. My ONLY deliverable is a concrete, self-contained `/workspace/PLAN.md` file that a separate implementation agent (in a fresh session that sees ONLY PLAN.md) will use. I must implement plans for SOS cards: **1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257** in `/workspace/cards/sos/`. \n   \n   PLAN.md must contain three sections:\n   - **Section 1 — Engine gaps**: a table `| Capability needed | Smallest change | Engine file / seam | Cards that reuse it |`, deciding for each mechanic whether the engine already supports it (naming the seam + an FDN card using it) or needs a new/extended capability (smallest shared change). Prefer ONE shared seam reused by several cards.\n   - **Section 2 — Per-card plan**: for each card, the oracle clauses, nearest FDN analogue, exact engine seam(s) to reuse, new engine change needed (reference gap table), and key edge cases worth a test.\n   - **Section 3 — Implementation order**: ordered list of cards + shared engine changes to make FIRST, grouped by shared seam, foundational engine work before dependent cards, simplest→hardest, one-line rationale per group.\n   \n   Hard rule: **Do NOT edit any `cards/sos/<id>/card_impl.py` or `engine/` file in this phase. Planning only.** Be concrete (name files, hooks, FDN cards, events).\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Magic: The Gathering rules engine in Python (`engine/` package), card implementations in `cards/sos/sos_<N>/card_impl.py` subclassing `CardImpl`/`Creature`/`Instant`/`Sorcery`/`Planeswalker`/`Land`.\n   - Triggered abilities via `TriggerManager.fire_event` + `TriggerRegistration(event_type, condition, effect, source, controller)`; typed events in `engine/events.py`.\n   - Replacement effects via `ReplacementManager` and `ReplacementEvent` subclasses (e.g. `MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent` with `destination`/`prevented`).\n   - Continuous effects 7-layer system (`engine/continuous_effects.py`): `ContinuousEffect(source, layer, sublayer, apply, duration)`; `Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS`/`SubLayer.MODIFY_PT`, `Layer.TYPE`, `Layer.ABILITY`; durations `DURATION_PERMANENT`(-1), `DURATION_END_OF_TURN`(0).\n   - Casting pipeline (`engine/casting.py`): `cast_spell`, `cast_spell_free`, `get_cost_reduction`, `_apply_cost_reduction`, `colors_spent` for Converge.\n   - Planeswalker loyalty (`engine/abilities.py`): `LoyaltyAbility`, `LoyaltyAbilityInstance`, `activate_ability`; targeting via `pw._resolve_target`.\n   - Activated/mana abilities: `get_activated_abilities`, `get_mana_abilities`, `tap_cost`.\n   - Novel SOS mechanics needing engine support: Converge, Prepared, Casualty, Paradigm, Miracle, Affinity-granting, coin flips, skip turns, land animation, restricted mana.\n   - `extra_turns` FIFO queue model for turn rotation.\n   - DeterministicPlayer scripted choices; test_utils helpers `create_game`, `set_board_state`, `cast_spell`, `declare_attackers`.\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Card specs (`cards/sos/sos_<N>/card_spec.json`)** — all read. Summary of each:\n     - **sos_1 The Dawning Archaic** {10} Legendary Creature—Avatar 7/7, Reach, complex: costs {1} less per instant/sorcery in graveyard; attack trigger to free-cast target instant/sorcery from graveyard, exile-instead replacement.\n     - **sos_4 Together as One** {6} Sorcery, complex: Converge — target player draws X, deals X dmg to any target, gain X life; X = colors of mana spent.\n     - **sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares** {1}{W}{W} Creature—Cat Cleric (mythic): ETB target player creates 1/1 W/B Inkling with flying; then if opponent controls more creatures, becomes \"prepared\"; Prepared lets you cast a copy of Swords to Plowshares (exile target creature, controller gains life=power), unpreparing it.\n     - **sos_57 Mana Sculpt** {1}{U}{U} Instant (medium): Counter target spell; if you control a Wizard, add {C} = mana spent on that spell at beginning of your next main phase.\n     - **sos_97 Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer** {1}{B}{B} Planeswalker, loyalty 3 (expert): +1 Surveil 2; −1 any number of target players each discard; −2 reanimate creature MV≤3 from your graveyard; −7 flip 5 coins, target opponent skips X turns (X=heads).\n     - **sos_120 Improvisation Capstone** {5}{R}{R} Sorcery—Lesson (complex): exile from top until total MV≥4, cast any number free; Paradigm (recurring free copy from exile at start of your first main phases).\n     - **sos_201 Lorehold, the Historian** {3}{R}{W} Elder Dragon 5/5 (expert): Flying, haste; instant/sorcery in hand have miracle {2}; at each opponent's upkeep, may discard a card to draw a card.\n     - **sos_226 Silverquill, the Disputant** {2}{W}{B} Elder Dragon 4/4 (medium): Flying, vigilance; instant/sorcery spells you cast have casualty 1.\n     - **sos_245 Witherbloom, the Balancer** {6}{B}{G} Elder Dragon 5/5 (complex): Affinity for creatures (self); Flying, deathtouch; instant/sorcery spells you cast have affinity for creatures.\n     - **sos_257 Great Hall of the Biblioplex** Land (complex): {T}: Add {C}; {T},Pay 1 life: add any color (instant/sorcery only); {5}: become 2/4 Wizard creature (still a land) with \"Whenever you cast an instant/sorcery, +1/+0 until EOT\".\n   - **engine/card.py** — `CardImpl` hooks: `can_cast`, `cost_reduction(game)->int` (generic reduction, clamped), `on_cast`, `on_resolve` (reads `self.chosen_targets`), `get_targets`, `register_triggers`, `register_replacement_effects`, `get_activated_abilities`, `get_modes`. `_reset_characteristics` resets `card_types`/`keywords` to `_original_card_types`/`_original_keywords`. Creature adds base_power/toughness/modified_power/toughness, `power`/`toughness` properties, counters. Planeswalker has `starting_loyalty`/`loyalty`/`get_loyalty_abilities`. Land `can_cast`→False, `get_mana_abilities`.\n   - **engine/events.py** — `AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature, attacker)`, `SpellCastTriggeredEvent(spell, player, card, controller)`, `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent`, `EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent(permanent, controller)`, `MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent(destination, prevented)`, etc.\n   - **engine/casting.py** — `get_cost_reduction` calls ONLY `card.cost_reduction(game)`. `cast_spell` sets `card.colors_spent`, calls `on_cast`, pushes StackObject; does NOT fire SpellCastTriggeredEvent. `cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone)` for free casts. `_resolve_spell` calls on_resolve then moves to battlefield/graveyard.\n   - **engine/combat.py** — `declare_attackers_step` sets `attacker.is_attacking=True`, taps unless vigilance, but does NOT fire `AttacksTriggeredEvent` (GAP). Eligible filter: `hasattr(c, 'base_power') and _can_attack(c)`. Damage uses `getattr(attacker,'power',0)`.\n   - **engine/game.py** — helpers: `deal_damage`, `destroy`, `sacrifice`, `exile`, `draw_card`, `discard`, `create_token`, `add_counter`, `remove_counter`, `tap`, `untap`. No surveil/coin-flip.\n   - **engine/zones.py** — `move_to_zone(game, card, from_zone, to_zone, *, replacement_event=None)` handles replacement redirection (only when leaving battlefield), ETB/LTB events, trigger registration. `move_zone` deletes `colors_spent` on zone change.\n   - **engine/abilities.py** — `LoyaltyAbilityInstance` (sorcery-speed, once/turn), `activate_ability`, `tap_cost`.\n   - **engine/continuous_effects.py** — EffectManager.apply_all resets objects then applies effects in layer/timestamp order.\n   - **engine/game_state.py** — `advance_phase` uses `extra_turns` FIFO + `_normal_next_index` alternation. No main-phase trigger.\n   - **engine/turn.py** — fires BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent at upkeep; combat steps; cleanup removes EOT effects, clears damage. No main-phase event.\n   - **engine/s